<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<graphml xmlns="http://graphml.graphdrawing.org/xmlns" xmlns:y="http://www.yworks.com/xml/yfiles-common/3.0" xmlns="http://graphml.graphdrawing.org/xmlns" xmlns:y="http://www.yworks.com/xml/yfiles-common/3.0" xmlns:x="http://www.yworks.com/xml/yfiles-common/markup/3.0">
	<graph id="G" edgedefault="directed">
		<data key="d6">
			<y:Json>{"version":"2.0.0","origin":"yed-live","theme":{"name":"dark","version":"1.0.0"}}</y:Json>
		</data>
		<node id="n0">
			<data key="d4"><y:Label.Text>&lt;h1&gt; Start &lt;/h1&gt;</y:Label.Text></data></node>
		<node id="n1">
			<data key="d4"><y:Label.Text>&lt;h1&gt; Read Trip Document &lt;/h1&gt;</y:Label.Text></data></node>
		<node id="n2">
			<data key="d4"><y:Label.Text>&lt;h1&gt; Query All Trips Document by City and Time &lt;/h1&gt;</y:Label.Text></data></node>
		<node id="n3">
			<data key="d4"><y:Label.Text>&lt;h1&gt; Any Trips Found? &lt;/h1&gt;</y:Label.Text></data></node>
		<node id="n4">
			<data key="d4"><y:Label.Text>&lt;h1&gt; No. of trips found &gt; 625? &lt;/h1&gt;</y:Label.Text></data></node>
		<node id="n5">
			<data key="d4"><y:Label.Text>&lt;h1&gt;nextBatch = [ ];&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h1&gt;pickupMatches = [ ];&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h1&gt;nextBatch array to store the next batch of trips from City and Time Matches to be used for API calls to find pickup matches (Max of 625 because the distance matrix API does not take more than 625 arguements)&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h1&gt;pickupMatches array to store trips who match by pickup matches&lt;/h1&gt;</y:Label.Text></data></node>
		<node id="n6">
			<data key="d4"><y:Label.Text>&lt;h1&gt; Loop that goes through the City and Time Matches array x, (for i=0; i &lt; x.length, i++), on each iteration it populates an array called nextBatch which will be the batch of trips (Max of 625) that API calls will be ran against using the new trip’s pickup location &lt;/h1&gt;</y:Label.Text></data></node>
		<node id="n7">
			<data key="d4"><y:Label.Text>&lt;h1&gt; nextBatch.length = 625? &lt;/h1&gt;</y:Label.Text></data></node>
		<node id="n8">
			<data key="d4"><y:Label.Text>&lt;h1&gt; i = x.length?&lt;/h1&gt;</y:Label.Text></data></node>
		<node id="n9">
			<data key="d4"><y:Label.Text>&lt;h1&gt; Execute a Radar route matrix API call, using each of the trips found in the nextBatch array. Using the &lt;code&gt;pickup_latlng&lt;/code&gt; fields as destination arguments against the new trip's &lt;code&gt;pickup_latlng&lt;/code&gt; as the origin argument. Identify the old trips whose pickup locations are within a 10km radius of the new trip’s pickup, then push (store) them (along with their vital properties) into a pickupMatches array. &lt;/h1&gt;</y:Label.Text></data></node>
		<node id="n10">
			<data key="d4"><y:Label.Text>&lt;h1&gt; Clear nextBatch array nextBatch = [ ]; &lt;/h1&gt;</y:Label.Text></data></node>
		<node id="n11">
			<data key="d4"><y:Label.Text>&lt;h1&gt; Execute a Radar route matrix API call, using each of the trips found in the Time and City filter array. Using the &lt;code&gt;pickup_latlng&lt;/code&gt; fields as destination arguments against the new trip's &lt;code&gt;pickup_latlng&lt;/code&gt; as the origin argument. Identify the old trips whose pickup locations are within a 9.85km radius of the new trip’s pickup, then push (store) them (along with their vital properties) in a pickupMatches array. &lt;/h1&gt;</y:Label.Text></data></node>
		<node id="n12">
			<data key="d4"><y:Label.Text /></data></node>
		<node id="n13">
			<data key="d4"><y:Label.Text /></data></node>
		<node id="n14">
			<data key="d4"><y:Label.Text>&lt;h1&gt; nextBatch = [ ];&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h1&gt;matchedTrips = [ ]; &lt;/h1&gt;</y:Label.Text></data></node>
		<node id="n15">
			<data key="d4"><y:Label.Text>&lt;h1&gt; Loop that goes through the pickupMatches array x, (for i=0; i &lt; x.length, i++), on each iteration it populates an array called nextBatch which will be the batch of trips (Max of 625) that API calls will be ran against using the new trips destination &lt;/h1&gt;</y:Label.Text></data></node>
		<node id="n16">
			<data key="d4"><y:Label.Text>&lt;h1&gt;nextBatch.length = 625? &lt;/h1&gt;</y:Label.Text></data></node>
		<node id="n17">
			<data key="d4"><y:Label.Text>&lt;h1&gt; i = x.length?&lt;/h1&gt;</y:Label.Text></data></node>
		<node id="n18">
			<data key="d4"><y:Label.Text>&lt;h1&gt; Execute a Radar route matrix API call, using each of the trips found in the nextBatch array. Using the &lt;code&gt;destination_latlng&lt;/code&gt; fields as destination arguments against the new trip's &lt;code&gt;destination_latlng&lt;/code&gt; as the origin argument. Identify the old trips whose destinations are within a 10km radius of the new trip’s destination, then push (store) them (along with their vital properties) into a matchedTrips array. &lt;/h1&gt;</y:Label.Text></data></node>
		<node id="n19">
			<data key="d4"><y:Label.Text>&lt;h1&gt; Clear next batch array nextBatch = [ ]; &lt;/h1&gt;</y:Label.Text></data></node>
		<node id="n20">
			<data key="d4"><y:Label.Text>&lt;h1&gt; Execute a Radar route matrix API call, using each of the trips found in the matchedTrips array. Using the &lt;code&gt;destination_latlng&lt;/code&gt; fields as destination arguments against the new trip's &lt;code&gt;destination_latlng&lt;/code&gt; as the origin argument. Identify the old trips whose destinations are within a 9.85km radius of the new trip’s pickup, then push (store) them (along with their vital properties) in a matchedTrips array. &lt;/h1&gt;</y:Label.Text></data></node>
		<node id="n21">
			<data key="d4"><y:Label.Text>&lt;h1&gt; Any Trips Found in matchedTrips array? &lt;/h1&gt;</y:Label.Text></data></node>
		<node id="n22">
			<data key="d4"><y:Label.Text>&lt;h1&gt; Read matchedTrips array of documents one by one till it’s end (loop), end yet? &lt;/h1&gt;</y:Label.Text></data></node>
		<node id="n23">
			<data key="d4"><y:Label.Text>&lt;h1&gt; Update new trip’s&lt;code&gt;status &lt;/code&gt;field to unmatched&lt;/h1&gt;</y:Label.Text></data></node>
		<node id="n24">
			<data key="d4"><y:Label.Text>&lt;h1&gt;isNewTripMatched?&lt;/h1&gt;</y:Label.Text></data></node>
		<node id="n25">
			<data key="d4"><y:Label.Text>&lt;h1&gt; Execute batch write &lt;/h1&gt;</y:Label.Text></data></node>
		<node id="n26">
			<data key="d4"><y:Label.Text>End</y:Label.Text></data></node>
		<node id="n27">
			<data key="d4"><y:Label.Text>&lt;h1&gt; Is oldtrip's status "unmatched" or "matched"? &lt;/h1&gt;</y:Label.Text></data></node>
		<node id="n28">
			<data key="d4"><y:Label.Text>&lt;h1&gt;Trip’s status is paid&lt;/h1&gt;</y:Label.Text></data></node>
		<node id="n29">
			<data key="d4"><y:Label.Text>Is oldtrip a proper match?</y:Label.Text></data></node>
		<node id="n30">
			<data key="d4"><y:Label.Text>Is trip status “unmatched”?</y:Label.Text></data></node>
		<node id="n31">
			<data key="d4"><y:Label.Text>&lt;h1&gt; Update old trip's &lt;code&gt;status&lt;/code&gt; field to "matched". &lt;/h1&gt;</y:Label.Text></data></node>
		<node id="n32">
			<data key="d4"><y:Label.Text>Add the old trip to the new trip's &lt;code&gt;matched_trips&lt;/code&gt; array field, update the &lt;code&gt;pickup_radius&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;destination_radius&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;pickup_distance&lt;/code&gt;, and &lt;code&gt;destination_distance&lt;/code&gt; properties. Set the &lt;code&gt;paid&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;reserving&lt;/code&gt; property to false; set the &lt;code&gt;mutual&lt;/code&gt; property to true</y:Label.Text></data></node>
		<node id="n33">
			<data key="d4"><y:Label.Text>Add the new trip to the old trip's &lt;code&gt;matched_trips&lt;/code&gt; array field, update the &lt;code&gt;pickup_radius&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;destination_radius&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;pickup_distance&lt;/code&gt;, and &lt;code&gt;destination_distance&lt;/code&gt; properties. Set the &lt;code&gt;paid&lt;/code&gt; property and &lt;code&gt;reserving&lt;/code&gt; to false; set the &lt;code&gt;mutual&lt;/code&gt; property to true</y:Label.Text></data></node>
		<node id="n34">
			<data key="d4"><y:Label.Text>Is old trip a proper match with new trip? and is new trip a proper match match with all members of oldtrip’s trip group? and Is (4 - total seat count of oldtrip’s trip group) ≥ new trip’s seat count?Summary: Do the old and new trip match properly and does the new trip match properly with every other member of the old trip’s trip group and are the remaining seats in the group enough for the new trip’s seat count</y:Label.Text></data></node>
		<node id="n35">
			<data key="d4"><y:Label.Text>Is trip already one of trip group’s potential_trip_members?</y:Label.Text></data></node>
		<node id="n36">
			<data key="d4"><y:Label.Text>Old trip's Trip group document update:Add new trip to potential_trip_members indextrip_id: new trip’s IDobstructing_trip_members:with their relevant fields which are: trip_id, pickup_overlap_gap, destination_overlap_gap and unknowntrip_obstruction: relevant valueseat_obstruction: relevant valueseat_count: new trip’s seat countunknown trip_obstruction: relevant value</y:Label.Text></data></node>
		<node id="n37">
			<data key="d4"><y:Label.Text>Does new trip match properly with old trip?</y:Label.Text></data></node>
		<node id="n38">
			<data key="d4"><y:Label.Text>New trip document update:Add old trip to potential_trips arraytrip_id: old trip’s IDpaid: truetrip_group_id: old trip’s TG IDpickup_radius: relevant valuedestination_radius: relevant valuepickup_distance: relevant valuedestination_distance: relevant valueproper_match: truetrip_obstruction: relevant value (may be true or not)seat_obstruction: relevant valuereserving_trip_obstruction: falsemutual: falsegroup_largest_pickup_overlap_gap: relevant value if applicablegroup_largest_destination_overlap_gap: relevant value if applicableunknown trip_obstruction: relvant valuetotal_seat_count: relevant value +++</y:Label.Text></data></node>
		<node id="n39">
			<data key="d4"><y:Label.Text>New trip document update:Add old trip to potential_trips arraytrip_id: old trip’s IDpaid: truetrip_group_id: old trip’s TG IDpickup_radius: relevant valuedestination_radius: relevant valuepickup_distance: relevant valuedestination_distance: relevant valueproper_match: falsetrip_obstruction: true (we know for sure)seat_obstruction: relevant valuereserving_trip_obstruction: falsemutual: truegroup_largest_pickup_overlap_gap: relevant value if applicablegroup_largest_destination_overlap_gap: relevant value if applicableunknown trip_obstruction: relvant valuetotal_seat_count: relevant value +++</y:Label.Text></data></node>
		<node id="n40">
			<data key="d4"><y:Label.Text /></data></node>
		<node id="n41">
			<data key="d4"><y:Label.Text>Old trip document update:Add new potential_trips index.trip_id: new trip’s IDpaid: falsetrip_group_id: N/Apickup_radius: relevant valuedestination_radius: relevant valuepickup_distance: relevant valuedestination_distance: relevant valueproper_match: falsetrip_obstruction: falseseat_obstruction: falsereserving_trip_obstruction: falsemutual: truegroup_largest_pickup_overlap_gap: N/Agroup_largest_destination_overlap_gap: N/Aunknown trip_obstruction: relvant valuetotal_seat_count: N/A</y:Label.Text></data></node>
		<node id="n42">
			<data key="d4"><y:Label.Text>Is trip already one of trip group’s matched_potential_trip_members?</y:Label.Text></data></node>
		<node id="n43">
			<data key="d4"><y:Label.Text>Old trip's trip group document update:Add new potential_trip_members elementtrip_id: new trip’s IDobstructing_trip_members: N/Atrip_obstruction: falseseat_obstruction: falseseat_count: new trip’s seat countunknown trip_obstruction: false</y:Label.Text></data></node>
		<node id="n44">
			<data key="d4"><y:Label.Text>Old trip document update:Add new matched_trips index.trip_id: new trip’s IDtrip_group_id: N/Apickup_radius: relevant valuedestination_radius: relevant valuepickup_distance: relevant valuedestination_distance: relevant valuemutual: false</y:Label.Text></data></node>
		<node id="n45">
			<data key="d4"><y:Label.Text>New trip document update:Add new matched_trips index.trip_id: old trip’s IDpaid: truetrip_group_id: old trip’s TG IDpickup_radius: relevant valuedestination_radius: relevant valuepickup_distance: relevant valuedestination_distance: relevant valuemutual: true</y:Label.Text></data></node>
		<node id="n46">
			<data key="d4"><y:Label.Text>Update new trip's &lt;code&gt;status&lt;/code&gt; field to "matched" and update the variable that represents whether the new trip has been matched, &lt;code&gt;isNewTripMatched&lt;/code&gt;.</y:Label.Text></data></node>
		<node id="n47">
			<data key="d4"><y:Label.Text>New trip document update:Add old trip to potential_trips arraytrip_id: old trip’s IDpaid: falsetrip_group_id: N/Apickup_radius: relevant valuedestination_radius: relevant valuepickup_distance: relevant valuedestination_distance: relevant valueproper_match: truetrip_obstruction: falseseat_obstruction: falsereserving_trip_obstruction: truemutual: falsegroup_largest_pickup_overlap_gap: N/Agroup_largest_destination_overlap_gap: N/A&lt;h1&gt;total_seat_count: N/A&lt;/h1&gt;</y:Label.Text></data></node>
		<node id="n48">
			<data key="d4"><y:Label.Text /></data></node>
		<node id="n49">
			<data key="d4"><y:Label.Text>Does new trip proper match with old trips reserving trip?</y:Label.Text></data></node>
		<node id="n50">
			<data key="d4"><y:Label.Text>New trip document update:Add new matched_trips index.trip_id: old trip’s IDpaid: falsetrip_group_id: N/Apickup_radius: relevant valuedestination_radius: relevant valuepickup_distance: relevant valuedestination_distance: relevant valuemutual: truereserving: false</y:Label.Text></data></node>
		<node id="n51">
			<data key="d4"><y:Label.Text>Old trip document update:Add new matched_trips index.trip_id: new trip’s IDpaid: falsetrip_group_id: N/Apickup_radius: relevant valuedestination_radius: relevant valuepickup_distance: relevant valuedestination_distance: relevant valuemutual: truereserving: false</y:Label.Text></data></node>
		<node id="n52">
			<data key="d4"><y:Label.Text>Is oldtrip a proper match with new trip &lt;code&gt;and&lt;/code&gt; is oldtrip not reserved (reserved = false)?</y:Label.Text></data></node>
		<node id="n53">
			<data key="d4"><y:Label.Text>Is oldtrip reserved?</y:Label.Text></data></node>
		<node id="n54">
			<data key="d4"><y:Label.Text>Does new trip match old trip’sreserving trip?</y:Label.Text></data></node>
		<node id="n55">
			<data key="d4"><y:Label.Text>Add the old trip to the new trip's &lt;code&gt;potential_trips&lt;/code&gt; array field. Include the &lt;code&gt;pickup_radius&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;destination_radius&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;pickup_distance&lt;/code&gt;, and &lt;code&gt;destination_distance&lt;/code&gt; properties. Set the &lt;code&gt;mutual&lt;/code&gt;property to true; set the &lt;code&gt;reserving_trip_id&lt;/code&gt;,&lt;code&gt;proper_match&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;paid&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;trip_obstruction&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;seat_obstruction&lt;/code&gt; properties all to false.Fields: &lt;code&gt;group_largest_pickup_overlap_gap&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;group_largest_destination_overlap_gap&lt;/code&gt; are not applicable (N/A)</y:Label.Text></data></node>
		<node id="n56">
			<data key="d4"><y:Label.Text>Add the new trip to the old trip's &lt;code&gt;potential_trips&lt;/code&gt; array field. Include the &lt;code&gt;pickup_radius&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;destination_radius&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;pickup_distance&lt;/code&gt;, and &lt;code&gt;destination_distance&lt;/code&gt; properties. Set the &lt;code&gt;mutual&lt;/code&gt; property to true; set the &lt;code&gt;reserving_trip_obstruction&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;proper_match&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;paid&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;trip_obstruction&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;seat_obstruction&lt;/code&gt; properties all to false.Fields:&lt;code&gt;group_largest_pickup_overlap_gap&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;group_largest_destination_overlap_gap&lt;/code&gt; are not applicable (N/A)</y:Label.Text></data></node>
		<node id="n57">
			<data key="d4"><y:Label.Text>Add the old trip to the new trip's &lt;code&gt;potential_trips&lt;/code&gt; array field. Include the &lt;code&gt;pickup_radius&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;destination_radius&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;pickup_distance&lt;/code&gt;, and &lt;code&gt;destination_distance&lt;/code&gt; properties. Set the &lt;code&gt;mutual&lt;/code&gt; property to true; set the &lt;code&gt;reserving_trip_obstruction&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;proper_match&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;paid&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;trip_obstruction&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;seat_obstruction&lt;/code&gt; properties all to falseFields: &lt;code&gt;group_largest_pickup_overlap_gap&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;group_largest_destination_overlap_gap&lt;/code&gt; are not applicable (N/A)</y:Label.Text></data></node>
		<node id="n58">
			<data key="d4"><y:Label.Text>Add the new trip to the old trip's &lt;code&gt;potential_trips&lt;/code&gt; array field. Include the &lt;code&gt;pickup_radius&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;destination_radius&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;pickup_distance&lt;/code&gt;, and &lt;code&gt;destination_distance&lt;/code&gt; properties. Set the &lt;code&gt;mutual&lt;/code&gt; property to true; set the &lt;code&gt;reserving_trip_obstruction&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;proper_match&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;paid&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;trip_obstruction&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;seat_obstruction&lt;/code&gt; properties all to false. Fields: &lt;code&gt;group_largest_pickup_overlap_gap&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;group_largest_destination_overlap_gap&lt;/code&gt; are not applicable (N/A)</y:Label.Text></data></node>
		<node id="n59">
			<data key="d4"><y:Label.Text>Add the old trip to the new trip's &lt;code&gt;potential_trips&lt;/code&gt; array field. Include the &lt;code&gt;pickup_radius&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;destination_radius&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;pickup_distance&lt;/code&gt;, and &lt;code&gt;destination_distance&lt;/code&gt; properties. Set the &lt;code&gt;reservint_trip_obstruction&lt;/code&gt;and &lt;code&gt;mutual &lt;/code&gt;properties to true; set the &lt;code&gt;proper_match&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;paid&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;trip_obstruction&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;seat_obstruction&lt;/code&gt; properties all to false.Fields: &lt;code&gt;group_largest_pickup_overlap_gap&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;group_largest_destination_overlap_gap&lt;/code&gt; are not applicable (N/A)</y:Label.Text></data></node>
